{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_3851B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说了我们的传闻，各地都有不少高手\n前来申请入队。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不过他们说“想先见识一下Boss的实力”。\n让这群不知天高地厚的家伙见识见识你的本事吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"如果能用打击攻击或CQC，在时限内把他们全部打晕，\n他们就会成为我们的强力伙伴。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"别让他们失望。拜托了，Boss！\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":41,"review_flag":""}]}